    <string name="dialogHelp_tipTitle">Tips</string>
    <string name="dialogHelp_tipText">

        Youtube : &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;i&gt;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvLJAVIXT_AVIj1gXq4P5xwgram&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

        &lt;b>Menus and dialogs&lt;/b>&lt;br>
        All menus and dialogs are opened at the bottom of the screen. If the dialog is large you will first see only the upper part. If you swipe it up, the rest will get visible. You can close them by pressing the back button, swiping them down or by clicking outside&lt;br>&lt;br>

        &lt;b>Long press&lt;/b>&lt;br>
        If you long press the menu icon or the \"Navigation button\", the \"Fast toggle dialog\" will show. If you long press the \"Bookmark icon\", the \"Filter dialog\" will show.
    </string>

    <string name="dialogHelp_filterText">
        You can tag your bookmarks with filters. In this way you can group your bookmarks. You can open the filter dialog by long pressing the bookmark icon. If you activate an entry a dialog will appear, where you can edit the name of the filter.
    </string>

    <!-- Dialog About -->
    <string name="changelog_dialog">


        Visit : &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;i&gt;https://blackbrowser-androidapp.web.app/&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
        Youtube : &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;i&gt;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvLJAVIXT_AVIj1gXq4P5xwgram&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
        Twitter : &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;i&gt; https://twitter.com/Black_Browser&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
        Telegram : &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;i&gt;https://t.me/blackbrowser&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;


Black Browser is a Simple, Lite weight, Fast, Free android web browser. A browser that puts privacy first.

Simple UI provides a more personalized user experience, making the entire interface more clear, balanced, aesthetically pleasing, simple and stylish with good usability and helps you to fast browsing.

Smart ad blocker that removes most of intrusive ads, Cookies whitelist, Remote content, Favorite website, Custom search engine and Data saver

Adding website to the home screen or bookmarks screen will help in fast and quick access to website and the smart save as pdf feature helps you to take complete website snapshoot and saves as pdf without lossing quality.

Black browser comes with 4 different options of theme System, Light, Dark and Amoled themes.

